      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Terre_Hill%2C_Pennsylvania",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Once the cigar‑making heart of Lancaster County, Terre Hill’s industry thrived in the 19th and early 20th centuries.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Terre_Hill%2C_Pennsylvania",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "As of 2025, Terre Hill is one of the few Pennsylvania boroughs without any traffic lights.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
